  "body": "## Changes since v26.10.1\r\n\r\n### Trident\r\n\r\n**Fixes:**\r\n\r\n- **Kubernetes:** Fixed crash caused by concurrent NodePublish calls.\r\n- **Kubernetes:** Fixed issue where a subset of possible SVM data LIFs were discovered during backend initialize and subsequent iSCSI volume attachments.\r\n- **Kubernetes:** Fixed volume clone metadata so the TridentVolume records the requested StorageClass and AccessMode when cloning across StorageClasses on the same backend, including when concurrency is enabled (Issue [#1162](https://github.com/NetApp/trident/issues/1162))."
